RULE TheSysTiIsTheProductOfTheNonZeroTiOfThePlanets
	HOLDS_FOR all
	DOMAIN game
	SPEC "the SysTi of a save folds the Terraformation Index of its planets in save order: while"
		+ "the value folded so far is below 2.220446049250313E-16 it takes the index of the next"
		+ "planet, otherwise it is multiplied by that index, or by 1 when the index is below 1; a"
		+ "planet whose index is zero leaves it unchanged"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/core-mapping/src/display/domain/rules/computeSystemTerraformationIndex.spec.ts"
	SPEC "the game writes the SysTi with one short-scale prefix per power of 1,000, k, M, B, T, Qa,"
		+ "Qi, Sx, Sp, Oc, No, Dc, Ud and on up to Qitg, the unit SysTi glued to the prefix"
		ATTESTED_BY "packages/core-mapping/src/display/presentation/formatters/formatNumber/systemTerraformationIndex.strategy.spec.ts"
	APPLIES_TO_SECTION @SECTION.TerraformationLevels
	RATIONALE "No save stores a SysTi field: the game derives it from the Terraformation Index of"
		+ "each planet, which the save stores as its terraformation levels"
	SOURCE "Wiki page Terraformation Index read on 2026-10-03, section System Terraformation Index:"
		+ "SysTi = Prime x Humble x Toxicity x Selenea x Aqualis, neglecting any Ti of zero;"
		+ "unlocks given as 100.00 QiSysTi, 15.00 NoSysTi and 5.00 UdSysTi"
